  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The MALO Community Grants is a flexible, small grants program, managed by DFAT through its Post in Apia. It is designed to support local community groups and organizations to implement locally-led development activities, complementary to the broader Australian development partnership with the Government of Samoa.</narrative>
